+|                                    ViBioMIR Phase 1 Pipeline Gaps                                  |
++----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+| 1. Ingestion & Registry   | Missing: Parquet iterators, SQLite WAL registry, crawl leasing.        |
+| 2. Web & PDF Crawler      | Missing: HTTPX async crawler, rate limiter, retry backoff, raw storage.|
+| 3. Extraction & Quality   | Missing: Trafilatura HTML blocks, PyMuPDF PDF blocks, fastText lang.   |
+| 4. Provenance Chunker     | Missing: Paragraph span packing, character offsets, token budgeting.   |
+| 5. Frozen Snapshot Store  | Missing: Sharded Parquet store, immutable manifest, exact span store.  |
+| 6. BTC LCS Evaluator      | Missing: BTC normalization order, whitespace_v1, exact DP LCS, many:many.|
+| 7. Official Exporter & Val| Missing: Single-root results.json inside ZIP, 1,200 query validator.  |
+| 8. Checkpoint Prediction  | Missing: Per-query inference resume, run fingerprint caching.          |
++----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+```
+
+These gaps will be addressed strictly task-by-task according to the TDD implementation plan (Tasks 1 through 11).
